  That matters for scoping. "Users get notified when tasks they care about change" implicitly names four subsystems that
  don't exist yet:

  1. [1mTasks[0m — a data model and storage, so there's something to change
  2. [1mUsers[0m — identity, so "who cares" and "who to notify" mean something
