  4. [1mNotification delivery[0m — generation, storage, read/unread, and a channel (in-app, email, push)

  Only #4 is the notifications system proper. The other three are its prerequisites. I'd rather not design a
  notification pipeline on top of three imagined subsystems — that's how specs get written against assumptions that turn
  out wrong.

  So my first question is a factual one about the ground truth.
